  "title": "Hemoglobin\u2013RDW interaction does not improve independent-cycle grip-strength prediction beyond flexible component effects and their ratio",
  "abstract": "A fixed hemoglobin-by-RDW interaction trained in 4,515 NHANES 2011\u20132012 adults did not improve maximum-grip prediction in 5,011 independently sampled 2013\u20132014 adults beyond flexible blood-marker, ratio and anthropometric effects: target MSE increased by 0.0323 kg\u00b2, with both survey-bootstrap intervals spanning zero.",
